        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and step into the world of Hilda – a cow enjoying the beauty of picturesque landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🎵 Listen 🎵</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the sounds of <i>moo</i>-sic or let the gentle breeze lull you into calm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🌿 Admire 🌿</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast meadow at any time of day – glowing with light in the daytime, or under the starry sky at night.<br>For a special atmosphere, you can apply one of the filters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage Camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt-Shift</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⏰ Additionally ⏰</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set an alarm, choose the time, and focus on what you’ve planned – Hilda will take care of the rest.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and step into the world of Hilda – a cow enjoying the beauty of picturesque landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🎵 Listen 🎵</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the sounds of <i>moo</i>-sic or let the gentle breeze lull you into calm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🌿 Admire 🌿</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast meadow at any time of day – glowing with light in the daytime, or under the starry sky at night.<br>For a special atmosphere, you can apply one of the filters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage Camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt-Shift</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⏰ Additionally ⏰</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set an alarm, choose the time, and focus on what you’ve planned – Hilda will take care of the rest.</p>",
